[CHANGE] benchmark_1/parts/dag_engine_lite/lib/dag_engine_lite.py: Implement DAG engine interface: frozen data types (DAGError, CycleError, NodeNotFoundError, NodeExecutionError, NodeDefinition, NodeResult, DAGRunReport), NodeState/FailurePolicy enums, and DAG/WaveScheduler/DAGRunner system-tier Protocol stubs matching low/dag_engine_lite.pyi.
[CHANGE] benchmark_1/parts/dag_engine_lite/lib/dag_engine_lite_impl.py: Implement DAG, WaveScheduler, and DAGRunner system-tier singletons: adjacency-based graph with validation/cycle detection, deterministic priority-then-name topological sort, dynamic-programming critical path, wave scheduling with READY/PENDING promotion, FAIL_FAST/CONTINUE_ON_ERROR/SKIP_DOWNSTREAM failure policies, and sequential execution with retries and consolidated DAGRunReport; register singletons via auto-generated __initialize__.
[CHANGE] benchmark_1/parts/dag_engine_lite/tests/dag_engine_lite_impl_test.py: Authored unittest suite for DAG, WaveScheduler, and DAGRunner system-tier singletons from the low-level contracts: covers node registration/edge management, validate/cycle errors, priority-ordered topological sort and critical path, wave transitions under FAIL_FAST/SKIP_DOWNSTREAM/CONTINUE_ON_ERROR, retries, and consolidated run reports, all inside isolated lifecycle phase scopes.
